          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Acute disruptions to oil and refined-product availability raise energy prices and living costs, which voters attribute to incumbent governments and reward populist, protectionist and security‑focused far‑right parties promising rapid remedies." />
