          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Significant disruptions to Gulf oil supplies drive up global energy prices and create domestic political and market pressure in Western capitals, causing them to scale back, delay, or soften new sanctions and trade measures against Russia, thereby reducing cumulative economic pressure." />
