          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained increases in long-term sovereign yields raise governments' debt-servicing costs and fiscal deficits, forcing hard spending cuts or tax measures that amplify intra-coalition disagreements and can precipitate ministerial resignations or withdrawal of support." />
