          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sustained rise in long-term yields increases sovereign borrowing costs and projected debt-servicing for EU/US governments, prompting fiscal retrenchment or greater parliamentary scrutiny that delays, scales back or staggers large multi-year arms commitments to Ukraine." />
